# Chunk 15 stage 4e (design §9.1): a body that built its answer in its own frame (which_children,
# get_child_info) returns with rsp lowered onto it; the lowered rsp is passed on to the emitted call
# site, which adopts it (prims_actors@runtime_call_asm). A body that kept rsp gets this frame popped as
# before. The release above ran below the answer and did not touch it.
