Lstc_run:
# X26 = value, X27 = root descriptor, X19 = the cursor, X20 = the copy control block -> X0 = the root,
# X1 = 0 (1: no table). The table is this copy's; X21 = 1 (on the spine) at the root. Lstc_run_flat is
# the same walk with the spine flag off at the root (one table for the whole value: the message copy).
